          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "**The representation and the exact dihedral orders.** The assignment $s\\mapsto\\sigma_s$ respects every defining relator of $W$ and induces a unique homomorphism $\\sigma:W\\to\\mathrm{GL}_K(E)$ with $\\sigma(s)=\\sigma_s$.",
          "uses": [
            "1.1",
            "1.2",
            "1.3",
            "2.1",
            "3.1",
            "4.1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact": "F4",
