        },
        {
          "case": "nonempty-choice",
          "status": "checked",
          "evidence": "No Choice is used: the proof is a strong induction on $\\ell(w)$ with finite case analysis, and every selection is determined by the least index in an explicit finite list (steps 1.3, 2.1)."
        },
        {
