          "status": "checked",
          "evidence": "Forward direction of (2): if the word is reduced, no sequence of braid moves followed by the cancellation of a consecutive equal pair shortens it, since braid moves preserve the value and the length (step 4.1, using step 1.2)."
        },
        {
