          "quote": "The prime subfield of $K$ is $\\mathbb{Q}$ ([[thm-prime-subfield-classification]], [[def-ring-characteristic]], [[thm-rat-field]]), so $\\operatorname{char}K=0$ ([[thm-characteristic-of-a-field-is-zero-or-prime]]) and $X^n-1$ is separable over $K$ for every $n\\ge1$ ([[thm-separability-of-x-n-minus-one-and-the-order-of-the-group-of-roots-of-unity]]).",
