          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "**Faithfulness of the signed action.** The right action of $W$ on $\\{\\pm1\\}\\times T$ is faithful, so $W$ embeds in $\\operatorname{Sym}(\\{\\pm1\\}\\times T)$; in particular distinct simple generators are distinct in $W$.",
          "uses": [
            "2.1",
            "3.1"
          ]
        }
